// Windows resource script (MSVC): embeds the default net as an RCDATA blob
// reached via FindResource(L"STK_EMBEDDED_NET", RT_RCDATA) in embedded_net.cpp.
// CMake substitutes the absolute net path (configure_file). rc.exe accepts a
// forward-slash path.
STK_EMBEDDED_NET RCDATA "@STK_EMBED_NNUE_PATH@"
